  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder perform best. This experiment tests the effect of using pca_n2000 RNA encoder (a lower-performing encoder in prior experiments) with singleprofile setting, while keeping image encoder and fusion method consistent. It isolates the impact of RNA encoder choice and profile setting, which are critical design decisions. This is the best use of the next experiment as it reduces uncertainty about the importance of RNA representation and profile setting, which are key factors in model performance."
}

